CHECK_CMD="npm run check"
BROWSER_CMD="npm test"

PLAN_MODEL=luna-xhigh
CODE_MODEL=ox-alpha
REVIEW_MODEL=ox-alpha
FINISH_MODEL=ox-alpha
FINISH_FALLBACK_MODEL=luna

CHANGE_SEQUENCE="add-status-mark-and-segmented-control declare-light-only-theming add-shadcn-adapter rewrite-consumer-integration-guide prepare-v1-release"

VERIFY_NOTE="
Read AGENTS.md, V1_ROADMAP.md, and docs/roadmap/02-v1-frontier-preparation.md. The decisions and
scopes in V1_ROADMAP.md are already resolved; do not expand them. Never regenerate or edit the
accepted zoo baseline to repair parity, and never take headless showcase screenshots. Complete C8,
C9, C10, C13, and non-publishing release preparation only. Do not run a release publish command,
push a release branch, create a tag, or advance De Ontwerper's pin. Those require the human's final
approval after the bounded Sol coherence audit.
"
